---
# Tests: same rules, minus checks that misread GoogleTest idioms.
#  - unchecked-optional-access: does not see ASSERT_TRUE(x.has_value()) as a guard.
#  - avoid-c-arrays: table-driven cases read best as plain arrays.
#  - exception-escape: test doubles may terminate on out-of-memory; that is fine in a test.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -modernize-avoid-c-arrays,
  -bugprone-exception-escape
